---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Elisha McCoy"
  description="How Elisha McCoy collects, uses and protects your personal information when you make an enquiry."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-header text-3xl text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-subtle">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-GB", { day: "numeric", month: "long", year: "numeric" })}</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 font-header text-body">
      <p>
        Elisha McCoy ("I", "me") is a freelance makeup artist based in Oxfordshire, UK. This policy explains what
        personal information I collect through this website, why I collect it, how it's used, and the rights you
        have over it, in line with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018.
      </p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">1. Who is responsible for your data</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Elisha McCoy, trading as a sole trader, is the data controller for personal information collected via
          this website. <br/> You can contact me at &nbsp;<a class="text-link underline" href="mailto:hello@elishamccoy.com">hello@elishamccoy.com</a> &nbsp;
          with any question about your data or this policy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">2. Information I collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">When you make an enquiry or booking request through this website, I collect:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Your name and email address</li>
          <li>Your event date, event type and location or venue</li>
          <li>The number of people needing makeup, where provided</li>
          <li>Any details about the look you have in mind or other message content you choose to include</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If a booking goes ahead, I may also collect information necessary to provide the service, such as travel
          details, and — where you choose to pay by bank transfer — payment reference details. I do not collect or
          store card details directly; any online payment is handled by a third-party payment provider.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Like most websites, this site also uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors use it, which collects
          information such as pages viewed, approximate location, device type and how you arrived at the site. This
          data is aggregated and is not used to identify you personally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">3. Why I collect it, and my legal basis</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li><span class="text-ink">To respond to your enquiry and arrange a booking</span> — necessary to take steps towards a contract with you.</li>
          <li><span class="text-ink">To provide the makeup service you've booked</span> — necessary to perform that contract.</li>
          <li><span class="text-ink">To keep basic business records</span> (e.g. for tax purposes) — necessary for my legal obligations.</li>
          <li><span class="text-ink">To understand and improve how this website is used</span> (analytics) — based on legitimate interest, or your consent where required for non-essential cookies.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">4. Who I share it with</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          I don't sell or rent your information. It may be shared with a small number of trusted service providers
          who help me run this business, such as my email provider, website host, booking or scheduling software
          (once selected), and Google Analytics — each of whom processes data on my behalf and is bound by their own
          data protection obligations. I don't share your information with anyone else unless required by law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">5. How long I keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Enquiries that don't lead to a booking are generally kept for up to 12 months, in case you get back in
          touch, and then deleted. Information relating to confirmed bookings is kept for as long as needed to
          provide the service and meet legal or tax record-keeping obligations (typically up to 6 years), after
          which it is deleted or anonymised.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">6. Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This site uses Google Analytics, which sets cookies to distinguish visitors and measure site usage. You
          can control or delete cookies through your browser settings, or opt out of Google Analytics using
          browser extensions such as Google's Analytics opt-out add-on. Blocking cookies won't stop you using this
          website or making an enquiry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">7. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Ask what personal information I hold about you, and get a copy of it</li>
          <li>Ask me to correct information that's inaccurate or incomplete</li>
          <li>Ask me to delete your information, where there's no good reason for me to keep it</li>
          <li>Ask me to restrict or object to certain processing</li>
          <li>Ask for your information in a portable format, where relevant</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent at any time, where processing is based on consent</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          To exercise any of these rights, email
          &nbsp;<a class="text-link underline" href="mailto:hello@elishamccoy.com">hello@elishamccoy.com</a>.
          I'll respond within one month.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">8. Keeping your data secure</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          I take reasonable steps to protect the personal information you share with me, including using reputable,
          secure third-party providers for email, hosting and analytics. No method of transmission over the internet
          is completely secure, but I aim to use commercially acceptable means to protect your data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">9. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website and its services are aimed at adults. I don't knowingly collect personal information from
          children, and enquiries should be submitted by a parent or guardian on behalf of a minor client where relevant.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">10. Making a complaint</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you're unhappy with how your data has been handled, please contact me first so I can try to put things
          right. You also have the right to complain to the UK's supervisory authority, the Information
          Commissioner's Office (ICO), at
          &nbsp;<a class="text-link underline" href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">11. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          I may update this policy from time to time, for example if the services or tools this website uses change.
          Any updates will be posted on this page with a new "last updated" date.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-header text-xl text-ink">12. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions about this policy or your data can be sent to
          &nbsp; <a class="text-link underline" href="mailto:hello@elishamccoy.com">hello@elishamccoy.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="border-t border-line pt-6 text-sm text-subtle">
        This policy is provided as a general starting point for a UK-based freelance makeup artist business and
        should be reviewed against the finalised booking system, payment provider and any other tools in use before
        the site launches, ideally with input from a legal adviser.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
